The model definitions in this directory are taken from Applio (rvc/lib/algorithm, rvc/train),
trimmed to the RVC v2 f0 synthesizer with the NSF HiFi-GAN vocoder and the v2 discriminator.
Applio builds on the RVC WebUI, which in turn builds on VITS and HiFi-GAN. All four are MIT
licensed; their notices follow.

